    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18314" root="زهر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزْهُورٌ</span></b> , applied by El-'Ajjáj to the lamp of the
darkness [i. e. the moon], <i>Made to shine;</i> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْهَرَهُ ٱللّٰهُ</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْنُونٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجَنَّهُ</span>: or, as some
say, <i>shining.</i> (TA.)

